        "original_id": "86f218d2-76d3-5fdc-9458-6518ffaf4905",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla, Themba Sekowe\n- Songs: \"One Dance\", \"Do You Mind\", \"Ngud'\", \"Camino Del Sol\"\n- Albums: \"Views\"\n- Roles: rapper, record producer, disk jockey, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Themba Sekowe was born in 1988 and is popularly known by the stage name DJ Maphorisa.\n- DJ Maphorisa is a South African record producer and disk jockey who can sometimes feature vocals in songs.\n- In 2016, Drake released \"One Dance\" on his fourth studio album, \"Views\".\n- Drake is a Canadian rapper.\n- Kyla is best known for her song \"Do You Mind\".\n- \"Do You Mind\" later appeared on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance\".\n- The song \"Ngud'\" was produced by DJ Maphorisa.\n- \"Ngud'\" samples Joakim's remix of \"Camino Del Sol\" by Antena.",
